## Third-party components

### System.Diagnostics.EventLog

- Version: 9.0.0 (NuGet)
- License: MIT
- Project: https://github.com/dotnet/runtime
- Use: optional synchronised audit logging to the Windows event log.
- Notes: this is the only runtime NuGet dependency of MemPilot. Everything else
  is P/Invoke against Windows system DLLs (ntdll, kernel32, user32, dxgi, pdh,
  userenv, advapi32, shell32, winhttp) plus WPF/.NET built-in APIs.

### Test-only dependencies

The test project (tests/MemPilot.Tests) references xunit and
Microsoft.NET.Test.Sdk. They are **not** shipped in the release binary and do
not affect the distributed artifact. Licenses:

- xunit / xunit.runner.visualstudio — Apache-2.0
- Microsoft.NET.Test.Sdk / coverlet.collector — MIT

### Windows API usage

MemPilot calls documented and undocumented Windows APIs at runtime
(NtSetSystemInformation, NtSuspendProcess, NtResumeProcess, EmptyWorkingSet,
DwmGetWindowAttribute, WASAPI, PDH, DXGI, …). No Microsoft code is vendored in
this repository: the calls are ordinary P/Invoke declarations that link against
in-box Windows DLLs, which are distributed under the Windows licence on the
user's own machine.

### Icon / visual assets

All UI rendering is done in code (vector shapes, geometry) or through WPF
built-in controls. No third-party icon fonts or image assets are bundled.

